  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies how origin and domain matches select records for a measurement deletion request.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This .NET enumeration represents the Android match behavior constants. <see cref="F:Android.AdServices.Measurement.DeletionRequestMatchBehavior.Delete" /> selects matching records for deletion. <see cref="F:Android.AdServices.Measurement.DeletionRequestMatchBehavior.Preserve" /> keeps matching records and selects the remaining records for deletion. The request's time range also applies.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/AdServices/+/593832a5beabbc740974dc6c07f3294cd8a3bc6d/adservices/framework/java/android/adservices/measurement/DeletionRequest.java">Android source for the match behavior constants.</a></format></para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
